cache-handler
https://github.com/Meow/cache-handler

This product is a modified version of caddyserver/cache-handler
(https://github.com/caddyserver/cache-handler), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, and was written by Sylvain Combraque (darkweak)
and the contributors of that project: Kévin Dunglas, Antoine Bluchet,
Burak Sezer, Frederic Houle, Malloc Voidstar, Matthew Holt, Po Chen and
Sherif Metwally.

Changes made to the original work, starting from its 0.17.0 release:

  * The caching engine, which was provided by Souin
    (https://github.com/darkweak/souin, MIT License), and the storage
    backends of https://github.com/darkweak/storages were removed and
    replaced by an engine and a storage written for this project (store.go,
    arena.go, diskfmt.go, fetch.go, slice.go, policy.go, size.go,
    platform_*.go).
  * admin.go, app.go, configuration.go and httpcache.go were rewritten for
    the new engine. cleaner.go and dispatch.go were removed.
  * The configuration options that belonged to Souin or to its storages were
    removed, and path, max_size, max_memory, max_file_count, inactive and
    lock_timeout were added.
  * The tests, README.md, the example configurations and go.mod were changed
    accordingly. The Go module path is github.com/Meow/cache-handler.
  * A benchmark was added (bench/).

The modifications are distributed under the same license as the original
work. See the LICENSE file.
